_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "                   not yet in CBV). EPCIS 2.0 sensorElementList carries the cooling temperature." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  1. receiving: food arrives at the cooling facility from the farm." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  2. other: cooling process itself (CBV 'other' is explicitly allowed for operations" .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  3. transporting: cooled food leaves for the immediate subsequent recipient." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  Cooling date: event 1 / 2 eventTime." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  Cooling location: readPoint on all three events + bizLocation on event 2." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  Farm-of-origin location: event 1 sourceList type=location." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "  Subsequent recipient: event 3 destinationList type=location." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cooling CTE per GS1 US 'EPCIS Recommendations for FSMA 204 CTEs' R2.0, §3." .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "KDE mapping:" .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Modelled as THREE events because CBV has no dedicated 'cooling' bizStep:" .
_:b232_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NO usfsma: extension fields ride inside the event." .
